WEBVTT

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.160
Aoyama-kun?

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:32.440
Aoyama... kun?

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:38.240
I am known as Deep Blue.

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:42.870
I will become the ruler of this planet.

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:47.290
It’s not true. It can’t be true.

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:05.640
This has to be a lie. There’s no way
Aoyama-kun is Deep Blue.

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:24.430
Aoyama-kun, it’s me, Ichigo.
You remember, right?

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:32.880
Yes, Deep Blue-sama. Finally you have
shown your natural form to us.

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:35.860
This is the moment
we have been waiting for.

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:38.760
What is going on here?

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:47.390
I don’t get it! There’s no way Aoyama-kun is Deep Blue.

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:48.840
Ichigo-san.

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:50.970
Stop this bad joke!

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:55.060
Ichigo was really happy that Aoyama-san
was the Blue Knight.

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:57.230
I can’t believe that he is also Deep Blue.

00:01:57.230 --> 00:01:58.220
That’s right.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:02.740
Please, Aoyama-kun, say something.

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:05.870
The three are one!

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:10.910
The Aoyama and Blue Knight that you know...

00:02:10.910 --> 00:02:14.520
...are just parts of Deep Blue-sama that you see before you.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:15.920
Parts?

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:17.650
Indeed.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:25.120
Deep Blue-sama’s spirit lives within the DNA of this planet’s humans,

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:29.030
and humans inherited the long dormant spirit.

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:32.500
And then when that spirit
tried to wake up,

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.150
there was no medium in which
he could awaken.

00:02:36.150 --> 00:02:41.260
Until now only the closest to human of Deep Blue-sama’s three spiritual body parts,

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:45.370
Aoyama and the Blue Knight, have appeared.

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:52.560
Meanwhile, Deep Blue-sama’s true spirit existed in an alternate dimension...

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:55.790
...and called us here from our far off home planet.

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:58.830
But now Deep Blue has awakened.

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:05.290
Now the other two spirits are no longer useful to Deep Blue and have been erased forever.

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:08.920
No way.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:10.680
Ichigo-san, get it together.

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:13.330
What is your objective in doing this?

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:16.180
We have just one objective.

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:18.380
We will once again

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:23.340
take back this planet we left three hundred million years ago from the humans.

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:29.310
In order to do this, Deep Blue-sama
was awakened from his deep sleep.

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:31.950
Quiche.

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:35.770
It’s too early. There’s no way this could happen.

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:40.470
The resistive force of the Mew Mew’s existence...

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:44.760
...acted as a trigger to allow Deep Blue-sama to awaken early.

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:47.760
Our existence?

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:52.250
It’s ironic. In the end we cooperated
to help awaken our enemy.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:03.130
Aoyama-kun.

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:09.100
It’s no use. The person here is no longer
the Aoyama that you know.

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:13.140
I don’t understand. Everyone, I don’t
understand what you are saying.

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:17.060
Because right there is Aoyama-kun.

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:21.620
Hey, please don’t look that way.

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:23.740
Please smile like you always do.

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:31.660
Please, Aoyama-kun,
say everything has been a lie!

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:38.180
Shoot! I should have done something sooner!

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:41.770
Ryou, you’ve done everything you could until now.

00:04:41.770 --> 00:04:45.810
But this result... I’m responsible for all of this.

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:47.470
Ryou! Ryou!

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:55.390
I will stay here. I promised everyone I would prepare some very fine tea for them.

00:04:57.740 --> 00:04:59.820
Make sure you come back please.

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:03.670
Keiichirou, I’ll leave everyone to you.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:19.980
Stop, Ichigo. It’s dangerous.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:35.450
Aoyama-kun gave me this bell.
It’s my number one treasure.

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:52.550
Aoyama-san, you really don’t know Ichigo-san?

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:57.060
Didn’t you become the Blue Knight
in order to protect Mew Strawberry?

00:05:57.060 --> 00:06:01.100
I was always admiring the relationship you two shared.

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:03.520
Nevertheless, this is too cruel.

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:07.550
Hey you, for making my sisters cry,
I’ll punish you.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.580
Mew Pudding.

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:22.860
Ichigo.

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:29.340
Ichigo.

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:31.930
Are you okay?

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:33.910
What was that?

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:40.580
What should we do?
Bu-Ling is really angry.

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:42.810
Then there is only one way.

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:44.020
That’s right.

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:46.560
There’s no other choice.
It’s come to this.

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:48.590
We have to fight.

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:50.930
Fight?

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:57.720
Reborn Mint Echo!

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:05.340
Mint Echo!

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:08.670
Mint Echo!

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:10.150
Minto is fighting...

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:13.120
Fighting with Aoyama-kun...

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:15.140
Mint Echo!

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:18.310
Mew Mint!

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:21.120
This is just too much.

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:25.170
Reborn Lettuce Rush!

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:33.220
This... has to be... a bad dream.

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:38.350
Reborn PuddingRings Inferno!

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:42.900
Reborn Pomegran’ Spear!

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:58.370
Please... If this is a dream, hurry and wake up.

00:07:59.550 --> 00:08:04.350
Get it together everyone!
There’s no reason for you to be fighting.

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:08.480
That’s Aoyama-kun over there.

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:13.800
Once we wake from this dream, he will
smile for me like he always does.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:14.940
Ichigo.

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:17.270
Isn’t that right, Aoyama-kun?

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:18.810
Ichigo-oneechan.

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:21.700
Ichigo-san.

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:24.200
This is a bad dream, right?

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.320
Mew Strawberry.

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:29.500
You can’t go!

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:30.620
Watch out!

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:33.080
That’s no longer Aoyama-san.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:35.080
Look at reality.

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:38.780
You’re all injured.
I won’t make you fight anymore.

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:47.050
Mew Power Extension!

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:07.350
Our transformation dissolved.

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:09.940
Why did this happen?

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:11.670
Everyone.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:19.820
That’s absurd. They are fools. Huge fools.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:24.870
I... What do I do?

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:27.440
Ichigo.

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:38.100
Minto!

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:43.810
Minto?

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.610
Get it together, Mew Strawberry!

00:09:46.610 --> 00:09:49.950
It’s painful, but how long do you intend
to act like a spoiled child?

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:51.820
That’s not Ichigo.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:59.720
The real Ichigo certainly always acts like a
fool, but she’s always trying her hardest.

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:01.840
How long are you going to weep for?

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:05.720
That’s right. Ichigo-san is always our energetic element.

00:10:05.720 --> 00:10:09.770
I don’t know what to do if
Ichigo-oneechan is like that.

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:11.010
Everyone.

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:13.680
Alright, stand up, Mew Strawberry.

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:18.950
If we don’t do something, all the living beings on this planet will die.

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:24.890
It’s as everyone says...
If you don’t stop him, the Earth...

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:32.230
That’s bad, Ichigo! That sword will destroy this planet.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:33.190
No way.

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:47.250
Don’t do it, Aoyama-kun! If you swing
that sword, everyone will die!

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:56.980
What should I do?

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:11.480
What should I do?

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:16.700
Everyone!

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:20.880
Finally, it’s the time when our wish will be granted!

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:24.800
Since our ancestors left this planet out of necessity,

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:27.680
we’ve waited impatiently for this day to come.

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:30.800
What do you plan to do with the Earth?

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:32.680
I have said it before.

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:35.060
It will be returned to us.

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:37.810
Then, why will you destroy the Earth?

00:11:37.810 --> 00:11:43.390
I can’t call for my comrades when it’s in this dirty state.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:45.570
Everything should be reset.

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:48.900
And what will happen to everyone on Earth?

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:50.820
I don’t care.

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:52.740
That’s just too selfish.

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:55.860
Humans are just as selfish!

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:10.290
Ichigo-san, watch out!

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:11.040
Ichigo!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.410
Masha!

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:26.820
Everyone.

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:30.990
Everyone will die!

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:36.580
Please make it in time.

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:43.510
So this is Deep Blue-sama’s power.

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:48.300
Before long, all the living things on
this planet will be extinguished.

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:55.350
This can’t be happening!

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:59.900
Aoyama-kun would definitely be sad to see the Earth become like that.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:03.760
You’re still around.

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:16.850
Whoever opposes me
shall be eliminated.

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:25.150
Everyone, are you okay?

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:28.260
I can’t be sleeping at a place like this.

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:31.950
When father’s not around. Bu-Ling has to protect her little brothers.

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:34.430
Are you okay?

00:13:34.430 --> 00:13:37.470
Taru-taru, thank you.

00:13:37.470 --> 00:13:42.350
I said you guys were fools before,
but the foolish one was me.

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:44.860
Darn, that Deep Blue!

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:46.960
Cheer up Taru-taru!

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:50.830
Now that you’re with me, Bu-Ling is a hundred times more powerful.

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:52.180
You...

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:55.780
I’m so glad you’re fine, Mew Strawberry.

00:13:55.780 --> 00:13:56.640
Retasu.

00:13:57.880 --> 00:13:59.530
Zakuro-san.

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:00.360
Minto.

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:02.540
You should fight, Mew Strawberry.

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:07.170
That’s right. Fight like you always do, Mew Strawberry.

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:09.880
You’re capable of doing it.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.370
Ichigo-oneechan.

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:16.590
Ichigo.

00:14:16.590 --> 00:14:17.960
Ichigo-san.

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:30.490
Aoyama-kun, even now I still don’t
know what I should do. But...

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:35.520
I just can’t watch anymore of this.
Everyone is being hurt.

00:14:36.280 --> 00:14:37.230
StrawberBell!

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:05.340
Reborn Strawberry Surprise!

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:17.160
Why did it end up like this?

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:21.690
Why is it that I am fighting with Aoyama-kun?

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:29.170
You are... no longer Aoyama-kun,
are you?

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:34.470
It’s as Pie said. Aoyama-kun has been extinguished.

00:15:37.170 --> 00:15:38.640
Aoyama-kun.

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:45.730
<i>Aoyama-kun.</i>

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:48.690
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:52.390
<i>I can still see Aoyama-kun.</i>

00:15:54.940 --> 00:16:00.390
<i>I have always loved you, Aoyama-kun.</i>

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:09.070
<i>I became a Mew Mew and began my days that were different from a normal girl’s day...</i>

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:14.030
<i>...but since you always smiled for me, I hung in there.</i>

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:23.060
<i>I hid that I was a Mew Mew, so we took a detour...</i>

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:27.460
<i>...but Aoyama-kun always waited for me.</i>

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:36.180
<i>So... this time, I will wait...</i>

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:40.540
<i>...until your kind smile has returned.</i>

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:49.980
This is nothing.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:53.630
I... believe in... you...

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:01.000
Mew Strawberry.

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:02.880
Don’t interfere.

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:11.000
Ichigo.

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:13.170
Ichigo.

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:21.180
Hang in there, Ichigo.

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:25.310
Cunning.

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:28.790
Ichigo.

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:32.000
I’m sorry, Shirogane.

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:35.880
My voice doesn’t seem to reach Aoyama-kun anymore.

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:38.680
It will reach.

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:41.910
You are the chosen super lady.

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:45.680
You becoming Mew Strawberry wasn’t an accident.

00:17:46.390 --> 00:17:48.460
You meeting Aoyama,

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:52.630
and the arrival of the Blue Knight to protect you also wasn’t an accident.

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:53.520
Ichigo.

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:54.190
Ichigo-san.

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:55.440
Ichigo-oneechan!

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:56.090
Ichigo.

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:01.550
Everything is certainly as the Earth wanted it to be.

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:04.610
So the one who can save the Earth is...

00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:05.270
Mew Strawberry...

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:07.570
...only you can do it.

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:08.730
Shirogane.

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:11.290
Also, Retasu.

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:11.990
Yes.

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:12.870
Minto.

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:13.580
Yes.

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:14.460
Bu-Ling.

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:15.210
Yeah.

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:16.010
Zakuro.

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:16.650
Yes.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:17.860
Your role.

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:23.580
I know. In order for Mew Strawberry to
get the Mew Aqua in the end...

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:26.340
For the sake of our future...

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:27.840
I understand.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.300
Leave it to us.

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:31.310
Leave it to Bu-Ling.

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:32.540
Everyone.

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:37.760
But there is no more energy left to transform.

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:39.400
Use this.

00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:42.470
Mew Aqua?

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:48.020
Just a little bit is left. This is the end.

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.550
Okay.

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:58.210
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:08.100
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:15.520
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:23.820
Mew Mew Pomegranate METAMORPHO-SE!

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:34.730
Everyone.

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:38.000
I am a Mew Mew.

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:42.750
That’s right. I am a Mew Mew.

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:45.330
We will save this Earth.

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:49.590
Thank you, everyone.

00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:52.390
I lost sight of what is important.

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:55.670
Everyone reminded me of what that is.

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:01.680
In gratitude, I will be fully at your service! ~Nya!

00:20:03.230 --> 00:20:04.300
Let’s go, everyone.

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:09.700
Aoyama-kun, in order to protect
the Earth you love so much,

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:21.670
I will fight you... with everything I have!

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:30.290
Aoyama-kun, I love you with all my heart.

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:36.960
So I know just how much you want to protect the Earth.

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:41.220
The way you currently are isn’t the real you.

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:46.270
But after this fight is over,
I can meet the real you.

00:20:46.270 --> 00:20:53.230
Aoyama-kun, in order to bring back
the real you, I will fight you.
